# Foodiecall — Flutter kitchen platform
#
# Monorepo layout:
#   admin/   Flutter app (landing + kitchen portal web; future mobile)
#   web/     Optional React landing (compare UI), built into admin/web/react
#   stitch_* Design reference screens
#   presentation/ Client PDF export tooling

